{"id": "3244926", "revid": "480743", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3244926", "title": "Mircea Nestor", "text": "MIRCEA NESTOR.\nMircea Nestor (24 octombrie 1936 \u2013 14 ianuarie 2023) a fost un inginer constructor rom\u00e2n, specializat \u00een proiectarea de hidrocentrale. A lucrat peste patru decenii la Institutul de Studii \u0219i Proiect\u0103ri Hidroenergetice (ISPH) din Bucure\u0219ti, unde a fost inginer proiectant, inginer-\u0219ef de proiect \u0219i director de proiecte complexe pentru amenaj\u0103ri hidroenergetice majore din Rom\u00e2nia \u0219i din str\u0103in\u0103tate.\nBiografie.\nS-a n\u0103scut la 24 octombrie 1936, \u00een Olteni\u021ba, Rom\u00e2nia. Tat\u0103l s\u0103u, Nistor Ioan, a fost inginer agronom la Domeniile Coroanei la ferma din M\u00e2n\u0103stirea, iar mama sa, L\u00e9onie Lemaire, provenea din Leuze-en-Hainaut, Belgia, dintr-o familie de comercian\u021bi de \u021bes\u0103turi.\nA urmat Institutul de Construc\u021bii Bucure\u0219ti, Facultatea de Construc\u021bii Civile \u0219i Industriale, \u00eentre 1959 \u0219i 1964.\nActivitate profesional\u0103.\n\u00cen 1964, dup\u0103 absolvire, a fost repartizat prin decizie guvernamental\u0103 la Institutul de Studii \u0219i Proiect\u0103ri Hidroenergetice (ISPH) din Bucure\u0219ti, unde a activat peste 40 de ani, specializ\u00e2ndu-se \u00een proiectarea de centrale hidroelectrice de suprafa\u021b\u0103 \u0219i subterane.\nProiecte importante.\nA fost inginer proiectant sau inginer-\u0219ef de proiect pentru numeroase hidrocentrale rom\u00e2ne\u0219ti, printre care:\nA coordonat \u0219i proiecte de sta\u021bii de pompare (Petrimanu, Balindru, Jidoaia) \u0219i a fost director de proiecte complexe pentru \"Nodul Hidrotehnic \u0219i de Naviga\u021bie nr. 5\" de pe Canalul Dun\u0103re\u2013Bucure\u0219ti.\nProiecte speciale.\nA fost director de proiect complex pentru \"CHEAP Tarni\u021ba\u2013L\u0103pu\u0219te\u0219ti\" (1000 MW), prima central\u0103 hidroelectric\u0103 cu acumulare prin pompaj din Rom\u00e2nia, conduc\u00e2nd studiile de amplasament, fezabilitate \u0219i optimizare \u00eentre 1985 \u0219i 1999.\nLa CHE subteran\u0103 Ruieni a introdus metode inovatoare de sprijinire a excava\u021biilor \u00een condi\u021bii geologice dificile, folosind ancore injectate \u0219i post-tensionate de p\u00e2n\u0103 la 20 de metri lungime \u2014 o premier\u0103 \u00een Rom\u00e2nia.\nVia\u021b\u0103 personal\u0103.\nA fost c\u0103s\u0103torit cu profesoara de biologie Margareta Nestor. Au o fiic\u0103, Mihaela Ileana Nestor, profesoar\u0103 de limba francez\u0103 \u0219i englez\u0103.\nA decedat la 14 ianuarie 2023, \u00een Bucure\u0219ti \u0219i este \u00eenmorm\u00e2ntat la Cimitirul Bellu Catolic."}
{"id": "3244927", "revid": "439805", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3244927", "title": "Divizia D 2005-2006", "text": "Sezonul 2005-2006 al Diviziei D de Fotbal a fost cea de-a 64-a edi\u021bie a Ligii a IV-a, al patrulea nivel al sistemului de ligi ale fotbalului rom\u00e2nesc. \u00centre 1997-2006 a purtat denumirea de \"Divizia D\". Campionii fiec\u0103rei asocia\u021bii jude\u021bene joac\u0103 \u00eempotriva uneia dintr-un jude\u021b \u00eenvecinat \u00eentr-un meci de baraj disputat pe un loc neutru. C\u00e2\u0219tig\u0103torii meciurilor din play-off au promovat \u00een Liga a III-a 2006-2007.\nBaraj promovare Divizia C.\nMeciurile erau programate pentru 17 iunie 2006.\nClasamentul campionatelor.\nDolj County.\nThe results between the qualified teams was maintained in the championship play-off.\nGorj County.\nPetrolul \u021aicleni and Par\u00e2ngul Sadu played a play-off match in order to determine the winner of Divizia D Gorj. The match tie-breaker was played on 9 June 2006 at Municipal Stadium in T\u00e2rgu Jiu.\nHarghita County.\nThe teams carried all records from the regular season.\nVrancea County.\n\"\u0218oimii Nisprod Mirce\u0219ti won the 2005\u201306 Divizia D Vrancea County and qualify to promotion play-off in Liga III.\""}
{"id": "3244930", "revid": "439805", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3244930", "title": "Liga a IV-a 2006-2007", "text": "Sezonul 2006-2007 al Diviziei D de Fotbal a fost cea de-a 65-a edi\u021bie a Ligii a IV-a, al patrulea nivel al sistemului de ligi ale fotbalului rom\u00e2nesc. \u00centre 1997-2006 a purtat denumirea de \"Divizia D\". Campionii fiec\u0103rei asocia\u021bii jude\u021bene joac\u0103 \u00eempotriva uneia dintr-un jude\u021b \u00eenvecinat \u00eentr-un meci de baraj disputat pe un loc neutru. C\u00e2\u0219tig\u0103torii meciurilor din play-off au promovat \u00een Liga a III-a 2007-2008.\nBaraj promovare Divizia C.\nMeciurile erau programate pentru 16 iunie 2007.\nClasamentele campionatelor.\nMaramure\u0219.\nThe championship final was played on 7 June 2007 at Dealul Florilor Stadium in Baia Mare.\n\"Marma\u021bia Sighetu Marma\u021biei won the Liga IV Maramure\u0219 County and qualify to promotion play-off in Liga III.\"\nVrancea.\nThe semi-finals were played on 31 May 2007 and 3 June 2007.\nThe championship final was played on 7 June 2007 at Milcovul Stadium in Foc\u0219ani.\n\"Energia Vulturu won the Liga IV Vrancea County and qualify to promotion play-off in Liga III.\""}
{"id": "3244931", "revid": "439805", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3244931", "title": "Liga a IV-a 2011-2012", "text": "Liga IV 2011-2012 a fost cel de-al 70-lea sezon al Ligii a IV-a, al patrulea nivel al sistemului de ligi al fotbalului rom\u00e2nesc. Echipele campioane ale fiec\u0103rei asocia\u021bii jude\u021bene joac\u0103 un meci de baraj pentru promovarea \u00een Liga a III-a.\nBaraj promovare Liga a III-a.\nMeciurile erau programate pentru 20 iunie 2012.\nClasamente Liga a IV-a.\nBac\u0103u.\nRelegation play-off.\nThe 18th-placed team of the Liga IV faces the 2nd placed team from Liga V Bac\u0103u. The match played on 12 June 2011.\nBucure\u0219ti.\nChampionship play-off.\nGroup 1.\nAll matches were played at Rocar Stadium in Bucharest on 24, 27 and 29 May 2013.\nGroup 2.\nAll matches were played at Romprim Stadium in Bucharest on 23, 25 and 28 May 2013.\nFinal.\n\"Chitila won the 2011\u201312 Liga IV Bucharest and qualify to promotion play-off in Liga III.\"\nC\u0103l\u0103ra\u0219i.\nChampionship play-off.\nFinal.\nThe championship final was played on 16 June 2012 at Ion Com\u0219a Stadium in C\u0103l\u0103ra\u0219i.\n\"Venus Independen\u021ba won the 2011\u201312 Liga IV C\u0103l\u0103ra\u0219i County and qualify to promotion play-off in Liga III.\"\nConstan\u021ba.\nChampionship play-off.\nThe teams started the play-off with all the records achieved in the regular season, but without the results with the withdrawn teams Gloria Albe\u0219ti and Pe\u0219tera. The teams played only against the teams from the other series\nChampionship play-out.\nThe teams started the play-out with all the records achieved in the regular season and played only against the teams from the other series.\nDolj.\nChampionship play-off.\nThe results between the qualified teams was maintained in the championship play-off.\nGiurgiu.\nChampionship play-off.\nThe championship play-off played between the best four ranked team in the regular season. All matches were played at Bolintin-Vale Stadium on 6 and 7 June (semi-finals) and 13 June 2012 (final).\nFinal.\n\"Av\u00e2ntul Flore\u0219ti won the 2011\u201312 Liga IV Giurgiu County and qualify to promotion play-off in Liga III.\"\nIlfov.\nChampionship play-off.\nChampionship play-off played in a single round-robin tournament between the best four teams of the regular season. The teams started the play-off with the following points: 1st place \u2013 3 points, 2nd place \u2013 2 points, 3rd place \u2013 1 point, 4th place \u2013 0 points.\nMaramure\u0219.\nChampionship final.\n\"Plimob Sighetu Marma\u021biei won the 2011\u201312 Liga IV Maramure\u0219 County and qualify to promotion play-off in Liga III.\"\nSatu Mare.\nChampionship final.\nThe championship final was played on 9 June 2012 at Olimpia Stadium in Satu Mare.\n\"Some\u0219ul C\u0103r\u0103\u0219eu won the 2011\u201312 Liga IV Satu Mare County and qualify to promotion play-off in Liga III.\"\nVaslui.\nChampionship play-off.\nChampionship play-off was played in a double round-robin tournament between the best four teams of the regular season. The teams started the play-off with the following points: 1st place \u2013 3 points, 2nd place \u2013 2 points, 3rd place \u2013 1 point, 4th place \u2013 0 points.\nLeg\u0103turi externe.\n "}
{"id": "3244932", "revid": "439805", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3244932", "title": "Liga a IV-a 2013-2014", "text": "Liga a IV-a 2013-2014 a fost cel de-al 72-lea sezon al Ligii a IV-a, al patrulea nivel al sistemului de ligi ale fotbalului rom\u00e2nesc. Echipele campioane ale fiec\u0103rei asocia\u021bii jude\u021bene joac\u0103 un meci de baraj pentru promovarea \u00een Liga a III-a.\nBaraj promovare Liga a III-a.\nMeciurile erau programate pentru 19 iunie 2013.\nClasamente Liga a IV-a.\nBac\u0103u.\nThe 17th-placed team of the Liga IV faces the 2nd placed team from Liga V Bac\u0103u. The match played on 30 June 2013.\nBoto\u0219ani.\nThe 14th and 15th-placed teams of the Liga IV faces the 2nd placed teams from the two series of Liga V Boto\u0219ani.\nBucure\u0219ti.\nAll matches were played at Rocar Stadium in Bucharest on 24, 27 and 29 May 2013.\nAll matches were played at Romprim Stadium in Bucharest on 23, 25 and 28 May 2013.\n\"Chitila won the 2012\u201313 Liga IV Bucharest and qualify to promotion play-off in Liga III.\"\nBuz\u0103u.\nThe championship final was played on 9 June 2013 at Gloria Stadium in Buz\u0103u.\n\"Voin\u021ba Lanurile won the 2012\u201313 Liga IV Buz\u0103u County and qualify to promotion play-off in Liga III.\"\nC\u0103l\u0103ra\u0219i.\nThe 13th and 14th-placed teams of the Liga IV faces the 2nd placed teams from the two series of Liga V C\u0103l\u0103ra\u0219i.\nConstan\u021ba.\nThe teams started the play-off with all the records achieved in the regular season and played only against the teams from the other series.\nThe teams started the play-out with all the records achieved in the regular season and played only against the teams from the other series.\nDolj.\nThe results between the qualified teams was maintained in the championship play-off.\nGiurgiu.\nNova Force Giurgiu and Av\u00e2ntul Flore\u0219ti did not pay their debts to AJF Giurgiu and, as a result, were not scheduled to play in the semifinals. In these conditions, the final played on 12 iunie 2013, at Or\u0103\u0219enesc Stadium in Mih\u0103ile\u0219ti, between Bolintin Malu Spart and Spicul Izvoru.\n\"Bolintin Malu Spart won the 2012\u201313 Liga IV Giurgiu County and qualify to promotion play-off in Liga III.\"\nIlfov.\nChampionship play-off played in a single round-robin tournament between the best four teams of the regular season. The teams started the play-off with the following points: 1st place \u2013 3 points, 2nd place \u2013 2 points, 3rd place \u2013 1 point, 4th place \u2013 0 points.\nMaramure\u0219.\nThe championship final was played on 12 June 2013 at Viorel Mateianu Stadium in Baia Mare.\n\"Baia Mare won the 2012\u201313 Liga IV Maramure\u0219 County and qualify to promotion play-off in Liga III.\"\nNeam\u021b.\nThe championship play-off was played in a single round-robin tournament between the best four teams of the regular season. The teams started the play-off with the following points: 1st place \u2013 3 points, 2nd place \u2013 2 points, 3rd place \u2013 1 point, 4th place \u2013 0 points.\nSatu Mare.\nThe championship final was played on 8 June 2013 at Olimpia Stadium in Satu Mare.\n\"Some\u0219ul C\u0103r\u0103\u0219eu won the 2012\u201313 Liga IV Satu Mare County and qualify to promotion play-off in Liga III.\"\nV\u00e2lcea.\n\"Hidroelectra R\u00e2mnicu V\u00e2lcea won the 2012\u201313 Liga IV V\u00e2lcea County and qualify to promotion play-off in Liga III.\"\nVrancea.\nThe teams started the play-off with bonus points depending on the place occupied in the regular season : 1st place \u2013 6 points, 2nd place \u2013 4 points, 3rd place \u2013 2 point, 4th place \u2013 0 points.\nThe teams started the play-out with bonus points depending on the place occupied in the regular season : 5th place \u2013 6 points, 6th place \u2013 4 points, 7th place \u2013 2 point, 8th place \u2013 0 points."}
