{"id": "3245207", "revid": "439805", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3245207", "title": "Liga a IV-a 2018-2019", "text": "Liga a IV-a 2018-2019 a fost cel de-al 77-lea sezon al Ligii a IV-a, al patrulea nivel al sistemului de ligi al fotbalului rom\u00e2nesc. Campionii fiec\u0103rei asocia\u021bii jude\u021bene joac\u0103 \u00eempotriva uneia dintr-un jude\u021b \u00eenvecinat \u00eentr-un play-off pentru promovarea \u00een Liga a III-a 2019-2020.\nAcesta este al doilea sezon \u00een care jude\u021bele au fost \u00eemp\u0103r\u021bite \u00een \u0219apte regiuni, fiecare format\u0103 din \u0219ase jude\u021be, iar tragerea la sor\u021bi a fost f\u0103cut\u0103 pe 15 februarie 2019, cu patru luni \u00eenainte de primele meciuri.\nBaraj promovare Liga a III-a.\nMeciurile s-au disputat pe 15 \u0219i 22 iunie 2019.\nClasamente Liga a IV-a.\nAlba.\nEchipe modific\u0103ri fa\u021b\u0103 de sezonul precedent\nArad County.\nTeams changes from previous season\nArge\u0219 County.\nTeams changes from previous season\nBac\u0103u County.\nTeams changes from previous season\nThe teams start the play-off with the points earned during the regular season, excluding results against the last two teams.\nBihor County.\nTeams changes from previous season\nThe teams from the 13th and 14th places of the Liga IV - Bihor County faced the 2nd place teams from the two series of the Liga V \u2013 Bihor County.\nBistri\u021ba-N\u0103s\u0103ud County.\nTeams changes from previous season\nBoto\u0219ani County.\nTeams changes from previous season\nBra\u0219ov County.\nTeams changes from previous season\nBr\u0103ila County.\nTeams changes from previous season\nThe championship play-off was contested in a double round-robin tournament between the five highest-ranked teams from the regular season. The teams started with half of the points accumulated in the first stage of the season.\nThe championship play-out was contested in a double round-robin tournament between the four lowest-ranked teams from the regular season. The teams started with half of the points accumulated in the first stage of the season.\nBucharest.\nTeams changes from previous season\nThe championship play-off was contested in a single round-robin tournament between the four best teams of the regular season. The teams started the play-off with the following points: 1st place \u2013 3 points, 2nd place \u2013 2 points, 3rd place \u2013 1 point, and 4th place \u2013 0 points.\nBuz\u0103u County.\nTeams changes from previous season\nThe 13th and 14th-placed teams of Liga IV Buz\u0103u faces the 2nd-placed teams in the two series of Liga V Buz\u0103u.\nCara\u0219-Severin County.\nTeams changes from previous season\nC\u0103l\u0103ra\u0219i County.\nTeams changes from previous season\nCluj County.\nTeams changes from previous season\nConstan\u021ba County.\nTeams changes from previous season\nCovasna County.\nTeams changes from previous season\nD\u00e2mbovi\u021ba County.\nTeams changes from previous season\nDolj County.\nTeams changes from previous season\nThe championship play-off was contested between the top six teams of the regular season. The teams started the play-off with the points accumulated in the regular season, but only from matches against the other qualified teams.\nGala\u021bi County.\nTeams changes from previous season\nGiurgiu County.\nTeams changes from previous season\nThe championship play-offs were contested between the two best-ranked teams in each series of the regular season. All matches were played at Ion Mangeac Stadium in Izvoarele: the semi-finals on 4 and 5 June, and the final on 8 June 2019.\n\"Mihai Bravu won the Liga IV Giurgiu and qualify to promotion play-off in Liga III.\"\nGorj County.\nTeams changes from previous season\nHarghita County.\nTeams changes from previous season\nThe teams started the play-off with half of the points accumulated in the regular season.\nThe teams started the play-out with half of the points accumulated in the regular season.\n\"Gheorgheni won the Liga IV Harghita and qualify to promotion play-off in Liga III.\"\nHunedoara County.\nTeams changes from previous season\nIalomi\u021ba County.\nTeams changes from previous season\nIa\u0219i County.\nTeams changes from previous season\nIlfov County.\nTeams changes from previous season\nMaramure\u0219 County.\nTeams changes from previous season\nThe matches were played on 25 May and 1 June 2019.\n\"Viitorul Ulmeni won the Liga IV Maramure\u0219 and qualify to promotion play-off in Liga III.\"\nMehedin\u021bi County.\nTeams changes from previous season\nMure\u0219 County.\nTeams changes from previous season\nNeam\u021b County.\nTeams changes from previous season\nThe championship play-off was contested in a double round-robin tournament between the top four ranked teams from the regular season. The teams started with half of the points accumulated in the first stage of the season.\nOlt County.\nTeams changes from previous season\nPrahova County.\nTeams changes from previous season\nSatu Mare County.\nTeams changes from the previous season\nIn the play-in round, the teams that finished in 2nd place in the three series competed. All matches were played at Daniel Prodan Stadium in Satu Mare on 27, 28, and 29 May 2019.\n\"Satu Mare won the Liga IV Satu Mare County and qualify for promotion play-off to Liga III.\"\nS\u0103laj County.\nTeams changes from the previous season\nSibiu County.\nTeams changes from the previous season\nSuceava County.\nTeams changes from the previous season\nTeleorman County.\nTeams changes from the previous season\nTimi\u0219 County.\nTeams changes from the previous season\nTulcea County.\nTeams changes from the previous season\nThe championship play-off was contested in a double round-robin tournament by the top four teams from the regular season. Each team started the play-off with half of the points accumulated during the first stage of the season.\nVaslui County.\nTeams changes from the previous season\n\"Moara Domneasc\u0103 and Juventus F\u0103lciu were relegated to Liga V Vaslui.\"\n\"Sporting B\u00e2rlad relegated to Liga V Vaslui.\"\n\"Hu\u0219ana Hu\u0219i won the Liga IV Vaslui County and qualify to promotion play-off in Liga III.\"\nV\u00e2lcea County.\nTeams changes from the previous season\nThe 9th- and 10th-placed teams of Liga IV V\u00e2lcea face the 2nd-placed teams in the two series of Liga V V\u00e2lcea.\nVrancea County.\nTeams changes from the previous season\nAt the end of the regular season, a special table was created for the 3rd-placed teams from the three series. The best two teams in this table qualified for the championship play-off. In this ranking, only the points earned against the first and second-placed teams in their respective series were taken into account.\nThe championship play-off was contested by the top eight teams from the regular season in a double round-robin format."}
{"id": "3245212", "revid": "41997", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3245212", "title": "Walker Edmiston", "text": "Walker Robert Edmiston () a fost un actor \u0219i american.\nBiografie.\nA \u00eenceput s\u0103 lucreze ca actor \u0219i actor de voce la sf\u00e2r\u0219itul anilor 1940. \u00cenzestrat cu o voce puternic\u0103 \u0219i versatil\u0103, a lucrat la televiziune \u0219i radio. Printre rolurile sale de voiceover se num\u0103r\u0103 \"The Great Mouse Detective\" de \u0219oareci, \u00een rolurile cet\u0103\u021beanului \u0219i gardianului Thug 2.\nA murit de cancer pe 15 februarie 2007, la nou\u0103 zile dup\u0103 ce a \u00eemplinit optzeci \u0219i una de ani.\nVia\u021b\u0103 personal\u0103.\n\u00cen 1950 s-a c\u0103s\u0103torit cu so\u021bia sa, Evelyn, care a murit \u00een 1998."}
{"id": "3245215", "revid": "41997", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3245215", "title": "Anna Neagle", "text": "Anna Neagle () a fost o actri\u021b\u0103, c\u00e2nt\u0103rea\u021b\u0103 \u0219i dansatoare englez\u0103. A ap\u0103rut \u00een peste 30 de filme, majoritatea produse de so\u021bul ei, Herbert Wilcox, a\u0219a cum s-a \u00eent\u00e2mplat \u00een 1943."}
{"id": "3245219", "revid": "41997", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3245219", "title": "Adele Jergens", "text": "Adele Jergens () a fost o actri\u021b\u0103 american\u0103.\nCarier\u0103.\nJergens a devenit cunoscut\u0103 la sf\u00e2r\u0219itul anilor 1930, c\u00e2nd a fost numit\u0103 \u201eMiss Cea Mai Frumoas\u0103 din Lume\u201d la Expozi\u021bia Mondial\u0103 de la New York din 1939. La \u00eenceputul anilor 1940, a lucrat pentru scurt timp ca dansatoare de mod\u0103 Rockette \u0219i a fost considerat\u0103 \"dansatoarea\" num\u0103rul unu din New York.\nDup\u0103 c\u00e2\u021biva ani de munc\u0103 ca model \u0219i fat\u0103 de cor, inclusiv ca dubl\u0103 interpretare a lui Gypsy Rose Lee \u00een spectacolul de pe Broadway \"Star and Garter\" \u00een 1942, Jergens a semnat un contract cu Columbia Pictures \u00een 1944 \u0219i \u0219i-a vopsit p\u0103rul \u0219aten \u00een blond.\nLa \u00eenceputul carierei sale, a fost adesea distribuit\u0103 \u00een roluri de dansatoare, cum ar fi \u00een \"Down to Earth\" (1947), cu Rita Hayworth \u00een rol principal, \"The Dark Past\" (1948), cu William Holden, \u0219i \"Armored Car Robbery\" (1950).\nJergens a jucat-o pe mama lui Marilyn Monroe \u00een \"Ladies of the Chorus\" (1948), de\u0219i era cu doar nou\u0103 ani mai \u00een v\u00e2rst\u0103 dec\u00e2t Monroe. De asemenea, a jucat-o pe prietena unui criminal \u00een \"Try and Get Me\" (1950) \u0219i a ap\u0103rut \u00een filmul \"Abbott and Costello Meet the Invisible Man\" (1951).\nA avut un rol \u00een \"The Cobweb\" (1955), regizat de Vincente Minnelli \u0219i cu Richard Widmark \u0219i Lauren Bacall \u00een rolurile principale. De asemenea, a lucrat la emisiunea radio din anii 1950, \"Stand By for Crime\", interpret\u00e2nd-o pe Carol Curtis, o tip\u0103 fermec\u0103toare, al\u0103turi de so\u021bul ei din via\u021ba real\u0103, Glenn Langan, care l-a interpretat pe Chuck Morgan.\nVia\u021b\u0103 personal\u0103.\n\u00cen 1949, \u00een timp ce filma pentru \"Treasure of Monte Cristo\", un film noir cu ac\u021biunea plasat\u0103 \u00een San Francisco, l-a \u00eent\u00e2lnit \u0219i s-a c\u0103s\u0103torit cu colegul ei de platou, Glenn Langan. Au r\u0103mas c\u0103s\u0103tori\u021bi p\u00e2n\u0103 la moartea acestuia, cauzat\u0103 de limfom, pe 26 ianuarie 1991, la v\u00e2rsta de 73 de ani.\nAu avut un copil, un fiu, Tracy Langan, care a lucrat \u00een cele din urm\u0103 la Hollywood ca tehnician de film. A murit din cauza unei tumori cerebrale \u00een 2001.\nAu avut un copil, un fiu, Tracy Langan, care a lucrat \u00een cele din urm\u0103 la Hollywood ca tehnician de film. A murit din cauza unei tumori cerebrale \u00een 2001.\nMoarte.\nJergens a murit de pneumonie pe 22 noiembrie 2002, la casa ei din Camarillo, California, cu patru zile \u00eenainte de a \u00eemplini 85 de ani.\nA fost \u00eenmorm\u00e2ntat\u0103 l\u00e2ng\u0103 so\u021bul \u0219i fiul ei la cimitirul Oakwood Memorial Park din Chatsworth, California."}
