{"id": "3246063", "revid": "41997", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3246063", "title": "Thomas Doherty (actor)", "text": "Thomas Anthony Doherty () un actor \u0219i c\u00e2nt\u0103re\u021b sco\u021bian din Edinburgh.\nI-a interpretat pe Sean Matthews \u00een serialul muzical \"The Lodge\" de pe Disney Channel, pe Harry Hook \u00een franciza de filme \"Descendants\", pe Max Wolfe \u00een rebootul HBO Max al \"Gossip Girl\" \u0219i pe Walter De Ville \u00een filmul \"The Invitation\" (2022). El i-a interpretat pe Sean Matthews \u00een serialul muzical \"The Lodge\" de pe Disney Channel, pe Harry Hook \u00een franciza de filme \"Descendants\", pe Max Wolfe \u00een rebootul HBO Max al \"Gossip Girl\" \u0219i pe Walter De Ville \u00een filmul \"The Invitation\" (2022)."}
{"id": "3246065", "revid": "41997", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3246065", "title": "Erika Vikman", "text": "Erika Susanna Vikman (finlandez\u0103 [\u02c8e\u02d0rik\u0251 \u02c8sus\u0251n\u02d0\u0251 \u02c8\u028bi\u02d0km\u0251n]; ) o c\u00e2nt\u0103rea\u021b\u0103 \u0219i compozitoare finlandez\u0103. \u00cencep\u00e2ndu-\u0219i cariera de c\u00e2nt\u0103rea\u021b\u0103 de tango finlandez\u0103, Vikman a primit prima recunoa\u0219tere dup\u0103 ce a c\u00e2\u0219tigat premiul \"Tangomarkkinat\" \u00een 2016. Ulterior, a primit aten\u021bie la nivel na\u021bional dup\u0103 lansarea single-ului \u201eCicciolina\u201d \u00een 2020, care a devenit primul ei hit \u00een top 5 \u00een Finlanda. Albumul ei de studio de debut, omonim, a fost lansat \u00een anul urm\u0103tor \u0219i a ajuns \u00een fruntea clasamentelor din Finlanda. Ea a reprezentat Finlanda la Concursul Muzical Eurovision 2025 cu piesa \u201eIch komme\u201d."}
{"id": "3246067", "revid": "119536", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3246067", "title": "Tennis in the Land 2025 \u2013 Dublu", "text": "Tennis in the Land 2025 \u2013 Dublu a avut loc \u00een a doua jum\u0103tate a lunii august 2025. \u0218aisprezece perechi de juc\u0103toare s-au \u00eenscris \u00een competi\u021bia de dublu a turneului de tenis de la Cleveland, Statele Unite, disputat pe terenuri cu suprafa\u021b\u0103 dur\u0103. Cristina Buc\u0219a \u0219i Xu Yifan au fost campioanele \u00een exerci\u021biu, dar Buc\u0219a a ales s\u0103 concureze la Monterrey Open. Xu a fost partenera lui Yang Zhaoxuan, dar a pierdut \u00een semifinale \u00een fa\u021ba lui Chan \u0219i Jiang.\nAnna Danilina \u0219i Aleksandra Kruni\u0107 au c\u00e2\u0219tigat titlul, \u00eenving\u00e2ndu-le \u00een final\u0103 pe Chan Hao-ching \u0219i Jiang Xinyu, scor 7\u20136(7\u20133), 6\u20134."}
