{"id": "3246100", "revid": "41997", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3246100", "title": "Adonxs", "text": "Adam Pavlov\u010din (\u00een Engleza : /\u02c8p\u028cvl\u0252vt\u0283in/ PUV-lov-chin, Slovac\u0103: [\u02c8pa\u028bl\u0254wt\u0282in], Ceh\u0103: [\u02c8pavloft\u0283\u026an]; ), cunoscut profesional sub numele de Adonxs (/\u0259\u02c8d\u0252n\u026as/\u0259-DON-iss; stilizat cu majuscule), un c\u00e2nt\u0103re\u021b slovac. Fost solist al trupei alternative londoneze \"Pace\", el \u0219i-a lansat albumul solo de studio de debut, \"Age of Adonxs\", \u00een 2022, care i-a adus numeroase premii, inclusiv Albumul Anului, Cel Mai Bun Artist Masculin sau Cel Mai Bun Artist Nou din Slovacia. A reprezentat Cehia la Concursul Muzical Eurovision 2025 cu piesa \u201e\u201d, dar nu s-a calificat pentru Marea Final\u0103."}
