{"id": "3246220", "revid": "119536", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3246220", "title": "Monterrey Open 2025 \u2013 Dublu", "text": "Monterrey Open 2025 \u2013 Dublu a avut loc \u00een a doua jum\u0103tate a lunii august 2025. \u0218aisprezece perechi de juc\u0103toare s-au \u00eenscris \u00een competi\u021bia de dublu a turneului de tenis de la Monterrey, Mexic, disputat pe terenuri cu suprafa\u021b\u0103 dur\u0103. Guo Hanyu \u0219i Monica Niculescu au fost campioanele \u00een exerci\u021biu, dar au ales s\u0103 nu concureze \u00eempreun\u0103 \u00een acest an. Niculescu a fost partenera Oksanei Kalashnikova dar au pierdut \u00een prima rund\u0103 \u00een fa\u021ba perechii Anna Bond\u00e1r \u0219i Katarzyna Piter.\nCristina Buc\u0219a \u0219i Nicole Melichar-Martinez au c\u00e2\u0219tigat titlul de dublu la Monterrey Open din 2025, \u00eenving\u00e2ndu-le \u00een final\u0103 pe Guo Hanyu \u0219i Alexandra Panova, scor 6\u20132, 6\u20130."}
